WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.630
Sam's dashboard shows one number.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.280
The client's spreadsheet shows another.

3
00:00:07.233 --> 00:00:08.083
Rewind.

4
00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:12.093
An AI assistant built it, with steps
nobody reviewed.

5
00:00:12.193 --> 00:00:14.863
Later, someone fixed one number by hand.

6
00:00:14.913 --> 00:00:17.173
Nothing tapped Sam on the shoulder.

7
00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:21.527
Sam burns an evening hunting for
ninety-eight dollars.

8
00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:23.903
Take two.

9
00:00:23.953 --> 00:00:25.783
Tamper Signal is that tap.

10
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:28.253
Sam just asks the AI to add it.

11
00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:34.893
Now every step leaves a receipt, a
fingerprint of what went in and came out.

12
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:41.000
A status light re-checks the links between
receipts in the viewer's browser.

13
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.900
The light is green, the data is clean.

14
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.140
Missing a receipt?

15
00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.060
The light is yellow, a human should look.

16
00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.397
Same edit again.

17
00:00:51.447 --> 00:00:52.567
Watch the corner.

18
00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:56.497
The light is red, the chain is broken.

19
00:00:56.547 --> 00:01:00.207
It points at the exact step, and the exact
amount.

20
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.070
Even an honest fix is still a change.

21
00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.380
Sam re-runs from the original, and green
comes back.

22
00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:17.167
It can't tell you the data is right, but
it can prove nobody changed it.

23
00:01:18.867 --> 00:01:21.279
Ask your AI assistant to add it.

24
00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:23.347
tampersignal.com
